## Made by work/make_exact.py from the card-by-card pass. Do not edit by hand.
##
## A card with an effect is in the game only when its rules have been checked against its
## printed text, sentence by sentence. MONSTERS lists the effect monsters that passed.
## NOT_YET lists the Spells and Traps that have not (every other one has).
## A card that is not exact yet is swapped out of the ready-made decks (see CardData.swap)
## and comes back by itself when it is added here.

